#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.shift.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.shift"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift:1 of
msgid "Shift rows by ``periods`` positions."
msgstr "按 ``periods`` 位置移动行。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift:3 of
msgid ""
"Positive ``periods`` shifts data forward (down); negative shifts backward"
" (up).  Positions introduced by the shift are filled with ``fill_value`` "
"(default: null)."
msgstr ""
"正 ``periods`` 将数据向前（向下）移动；负值向后（向上）移动。移动引入的"
"位置用 ``fill_value`` 填充（默认：null）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift:7 of
msgid "Number of positions to shift.  Positive = forward, negative = backward."
msgstr "要移动的位置数。正值=向前，负值=向后。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift:9 of
msgid "Value to fill positions introduced by shifting.  None produces null."
msgstr "用于填充移动引入位置的值。None 产生 null。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift:11 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) to shift.  If None, all columns are shifted. Non-selected "
"columns are passed through unchanged."
msgstr "要移动的列。如果为 None，则移动所有列。未选择的列保持不变。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift:15 of
msgid ""
"Shifted LiteFrame with the same shape and columns. Output dtypes depend "
"on the input dtype and ``fill_value``: when ``fill_value`` is None (the "
"default) input dtypes are preserved; when a ``fill_value`` is supplied a "
"column may be widened (e.g. an integer column with a float fill becomes "
"Float64, a string fill becomes String). Boolean columns coerce numeric "
"fills to bool; decimal columns derive precision from the fill value; a "
"string fill on a boolean column is rejected at plan time. Non-selected "
"(passthrough) columns keep their input dtypes."
msgstr ""
"具有相同形状和列的移动后 LiteFrame。输出 dtypes 取决于输入 dtype 和 ``"
"fill_value``：当 ``fill_value`` 为 None（默认值）时，保留输入 dtypes；当"
"提供 ``fill_value`` 时，列可能会变宽（例如，带有浮点填充的整数列变为 "
"Float64，字符串填充变为 String）。布尔列将数值填充强制转换为 bool；十进制"
"列从填充值获取精度；在布尔列上使用字符串填充会在计划时被拒绝。未选择的（"
"传递）列保持其输入 dtypes。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift:28 of
msgid ":py:obj:`diff`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift:29 of
msgid "Compute the difference between consecutive rows."
msgstr "计算连续行之间的差异。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift:31 of
msgid ":py:obj:`pct_change`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift:32 of
msgid "Compute percent change over given periods."
msgstr "计算给定期间的百分比变化。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift:34 of
msgid ":py:obj:`rolling`"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.shift.shift:35 of
msgid "Provide rolling-window calculations."
msgstr "提供滚动窗口计算。"

